				{
					"id": 721050302,
					"content": "那麼，如果二位已經準備妥當…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050303,
					"content": "等等！在那之前，我還有些問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050304,
					"content": "請您儘管問。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050305,
					"content": "之前面具巫女小姐說，等時機合適，會將一切都全盤托出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050306,
					"content": "確實是這樣。但如果可以的話，能否等到「神櫻大祓」完成之後呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050307,
					"content": "神櫻一直在述說她的苦痛呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050308,
					"content": "儘管這麼說，真的相當失禮…畢竟，二位已經付出了這麼多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050309,
					"content": "真的非常抱歉，請您諒解…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050310,
						721050311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050310,
					"content": "好吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 721050312,
					"content": "哼，好吧。一定要信守諾言喔！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050313,
					"content": "呵呵，那是自然。謝謝兩位的體恤。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050314,
					"content": "那麼，我要解除結界了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050315,
					"content": "「…東至鯨淵，西達燼海。南至炎光，北達弱水…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050316,
					"content": "「…千枝萬脈，請除禍災。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "花散里"
				},
				{
					"id": 721050311,
					"content": "我相信妳。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						721050312
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7210504,
